@startuml
title RAG Architecture - Ingestion and Query
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor Administrator
actor Citizen
component "React Web" as Web
component "Express API / RAG Adapter" as API
component "RAG FastAPI Service" as RAG
component "Document Extractor & Cleaner" as Extractor
component "Chunker" as Chunker
component "Embedding Adapter" as Embed
component "Retriever" as Retriever
component "Grounded Answer Generator" as Generator
database "ChromaDB" as Chroma
folder "Authorized Document Store" as Docs
cloud "Gemini APIs" as Gemini

Administrator --> Web : Manage authorized documents
Web --> API
API --> Docs : Store versioned document
API --> RAG : Request ingestion
RAG --> Extractor
Extractor --> Chunker
Chunker --> Embed
Embed --> Gemini : Generate embeddings
Embed --> Chroma : Store chunks, vectors, source metadata

Citizen --> Web : Ask question
Web --> API : Authenticated/controlled query
API --> RAG
RAG --> Retriever
Retriever --> Gemini : Query embedding
Retriever --> Chroma : Similarity search
Retriever --> Generator : Relevant chunks + sources
Generator --> Gemini : Grounded prompt
Generator --> RAG : Answer or abstention + citations
RAG --> API
API --> Web

note bottom of RAG
  No private complaint database access.
  Unsupported answers must abstain.
end note
@enduml

